# ============================================================
# 小红书搜索/原图 API  —  .gitignore
# 原则：代码与文档入库；凭据、样本、大文件、抓包数据一律不入库
# ============================================================

# --- 凭据：浏览器 profile（内含登录 cookie，绝不入库）---
**/chrome-profile-*/
workspace/chrome-profile-xhs/
workspace/chrome-profile-guest/
**/Cookies
**/Login Data
**/Local State

# --- 凭据：抓包产物与证书 ---
workspace/capture/*.jsonl
workspace/capture/*.json
workspace/capture/*.txt
workspace/capture/*.png
workspace/capture/*.har
workspace/capture/*.0
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/login_ok.json

# --- 凭据：mitmproxy 流量文件（含 shield 签名与 cookie）---
**/*.flows
**/*.flow

# --- 大体积实验产物（结论已写入文档，原始字节不必入库）---
workspace/capture/imgtest/
workspace/capture/testpic.jpg
workspace/capture/ui_*.xml
workspace/capture/*.bin

# --- 样本与工具链（体积大，按需本地准备）---
samples/
tools/
workspace/xhs-jadx/
workspace/apktool/

# --- 下载产物（可达数 GB）---
workspace/downloads/

# --- DSH 本地配置 ---
.dsh/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# --- 编辑器 / 系统 ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- 日志与临时 ---
*.log
*.part
*.tmp
~$*
